/* The executable's icon.
 *
 * claudaga.ico beside this file is generated by the game from the same polygons
 * it draws the fighter with:
 *
 *     claudaga --icon res\claudaga.ico
 *
 * It is committed because the exe cannot link an icon that does not exist yet,
 * and regenerating it is only needed when the fighter's artwork changes.
 *
 * Windows takes the lowest-numbered icon resource as the application's, so this
 * is 1 and there is nothing else here. */
1 ICON "claudaga.ico"
